   "subject": "Use of formula option in addqtl()",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi there,<div><br></div><div>I have some confusion over the use of the formula option in addqtl(). I&#39;m hoping someone can shine a light for me here.</div><div>For some reason, I assume by not providing an explicit formula to addqtl, it by default uses the qtl object (provided as input option) as an additive covariate and searches for any additional additive QTL. Basically, i&#39;m thinking the following calls are equivalent</div><div><br></div><div>#We make a qtl object with <b>one</b> qtl</div><div>qtl1 &lt;- makeqtl(args)<br></div><div>#Then the following two calls should be equivalent</div><div>addqtl(cross, qtl=qtl1, formula=y~Q1+Q2)</div><div>addqtl(cross, qtl=qtl1)<br></div><div><br></div><div>This could be an incorrect assumption but any light on this would be helpful. Specifically, I have genotypes (~8000 on 384 individuals) called using the MSG (Andolfatto et al 2011) pipeline for a Backcross. I read these into R (3.4.4) using David Sterns read.cross.msg (<a href=\"https://github.com/dstern/read_cross_msg/blob/master/read.cross.msg.1.5.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/dstern/read_cross_msg/blob/master/read.cross.msg.1.5.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792446675886000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3r_R1CPvOHKFkithsy4eCu\">https://github.com/dstern/read_cross_msg/blob/master/read.cross.msg.1.5.R</a>) function. I then perform the following in with qtl (<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;font-size:10.4pt;white-space:pre-wrap\">qtl_1.42-8):</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;font-size:10.4pt;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;font-size:10.4pt;white-space:pre-wrap\">#covariates for the qtl analysis</span></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><span style=\"font-size:13.8667px;white-space:pre-wrap\">body &lt;- pull.pheno(eye, c(&quot;Leg2_Av&quot;, &quot;Leg3_Av&quot;, &quot;sex&quot;))</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><span style=\"font-size:13.8667px;white-space:pre-wrap\">#scan one\r\n<a href=\"http://eyearea.hk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://eyearea.hk&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792446675886000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28TETLYv9Oc2rMIIL5_qbz\">eyearea.hk</a> &lt;- scanone(eye, pheno.col=3, method=&quot;hk&quot;,addcovar=body, verbose=T)\r\nplot(<a href=\"http://eyearea.hk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://eyearea.hk&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792446675886000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28TETLYv9Oc2rMIIL5_qbz\">eyearea.hk</a>, chr=3) #attached: <span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0)\">scanone.png</span></span></font><br></div><div><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\">#          chr      pos   lod\r\n#2:39184043   2 39184043 2.310\r\n#3:39299663   3 39299663 4.990\r\n#4:92481      4    92481 0.885\r\n#X:8357231    X  8357231 2.180</span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\">#then i make a qtl object with highest lod score</span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><span style=\"font-size:13.8667px;white-space:pre-wrap\">qtl1 &lt;- makeqtl(eye, chr=3, pos=39299663, what=&quot;prob&quot;)</span><span style=\"font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></span></font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><span style=\"font-size:13.8667px;white-space:pre-wrap\">#and run addqtl without a formula to find evidence for additional additive qtl</span></font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><span style=\"font-size:13.8667px;white-space:pre-wrap\">eyearea.hk2_nf &lt;- addqtl(eye, pheno.col = 3, qtl=qtl1, covar=body, method=&quot;hk&quot; )</span></font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Warning message:\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In addqtl(eye, pheno.col = 3, qtl = qtl1, covar = body, method = &quot;hk&quot;) :\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> Dropping 2 individuals with missing phenotypes.</span></pre><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><span style=\"font-size:13.8667px;white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\nplot(eyearea.hk2_nf) #<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0)\">attached: addqtl_Noformula.png</span> \r\nsummary(eyearea.hk2_nf)<br></span></font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\">#           chr      pos     lod\r\n#2:39184043   2 39184043   2.766\r\n#3:609806     3   609806   4.270\r\n#4:100310     4   100310   0.735\r\n#X:8357231    X  8357231 -53.824</span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\">#and then addqtl with a formula saying that any additional qtl (Q2) is additive with Q1</span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><span style=\"font-size:13.8667px;white-space:pre-wrap\">eyearea.hk2_f &lt;- addqtl(eye, pheno.col = 3, qtl=qtl1, covar=body, <i>formula=y~Q1+Q2</i>, method=&quot;hk&quot; )</span></font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Warning message:\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In addqtl(eye, pheno.col = 3, qtl = qtl1, covar = body, formula = y ~  :\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> Dropping 1 individuals with missing phenotypes.</span></pre><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><span style=\"font-size:13.8667px;white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\nplot(eyearea.hk2_f) </span></font> #<span style=\"font-size:13.8667px;white-space:pre-wrap;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;background-color:rgb(255,255,0)\">attached: addqtl_formula.png</span><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><span style=\"font-size:13.8667px;white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\nsummary(eyearea.hk2_f)</span><span style=\"font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></span></font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\">#          chr     pos   lod\r\n#2:4714      2    4714 2.114\r\n#3:2903347   3 2903347 3.318\r\n#4:39884     4   39884 0.923\r\n#X:8643217   X 8643217 5.265</span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">The two runs of addqtl are quite different and I&#39;m not sure what the highly negative LOD on the X could mean (in the run with no formula). Surely the one or two individuals dropped between the analysis could make this difference? And to be honest, I&#39;m not sure why a different number of phenotypes are dropped between the two instances. What is addqtl doing when no formula is </span><span style=\"font-size:13.8667px;white-space:pre-wrap\">specified</span><span style=\"font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">? </span></font></font></span><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Any input would be appreciated.</font></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">best,</font></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Saad</font></pre></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><span style=\"font-size:13.8667px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></span></pre></span></pre></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
